{"id":"wkprlxmjjlvq43x0lb17w9ymp","title":"全球气候大会COP31聚焦“35 by 35”电气化倡议","originalTitle":"电气化站上COP31议程中心","summary":"COP31在土耳其安塔利亚召开，重点讨论了“35 by 35”倡议，旨在到2035年将全球电力占终端能源消费的比重提高至35%。该倡议提出全球电力占比目前为23%，距离目标仍有差距。中国已构建全球最大的可再生能源体系，有望在全球电气化浪潮中获益，但需加强国际合作。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15321561.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:53:31.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T12:23:35.831Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T12:23:35.831Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":32,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(朱清华ZQH)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}